\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Definition}
\title{Dyadic increment}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{Fix #{m>0}, and let #{f} be the coordinate process of the
law in \ref{fdip-00BC}. For points #{a,b} of the
\vocabk{dyadic index}{fdip-00B6}, the
\newvocab{dyadic increment} is
##{d_m(a,b)
=\bigl(\mathbb E\lvert f_a-f_b\rvert^2\bigr)^{1/2},}
and #{d_m(a,a)=0}.}
